      "Make your own copy of this spreadsheet.",
      "Connect Google Sheets in n8n. Set sheetUrl in node 1 to your copy; all four Sheets nodes use it.",
      "Keep every tab and row-1 header unchanged. Record key (run key plus post ID) is the row match key; Run summary uses Run key.",
      "Connect Apify and OpenAI, edit node 1, and run once manually. Reuse a run key only to refresh the same search snapshot.",
      "Keep this workflow inactive; this template has no schedule. Review the output before sharing or acting."
